      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/cuisine/salads.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "43dec4253e2a8429370fc1453081e6ed4fab7309c3ad808c8dad8c77e70fb0ea",
      "ru": "Наполните миску салатом — и утолите голод!",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/cuisine/toasted_seeds.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "be6fb4864e4119dfafe354ab0fcb70dccb627e4d0f9441e084276d2eaee6dd93",
      "ru": "Объедините любые 4 семени, одного или разных видов, чтобы получить смесь семян.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/cuisine/toasted_seeds.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/1/text",
      "source_sha256": "b3e47e74e04b2e423940561ceb7ee2ac3dc47c029d78f3dd1f0a8631d5161f36",
      "ru": "Простая быстрая закуска из лишних семян — прилив сил, когда он нужен!",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/antler_hat.json",
      "pointer": "/name",
      "source_sha256": "60f8d81f354b037fca667139606a16e8954aaef2109b54d64829ea2c2e2366b0",
      "ru": "Шапка с рогами",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/antler_hat.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "5f11532277a02d600c0eff7d9aa87bbb32b7414370a875a472ef87a6d2a08b3d",
      "ru": "Из рогов можно сделать очень красивую и полезную шляпу!",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/antler_hat.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/1/text",
      "source_sha256": "f4078aabf7b2359e576f185879d35a7625ea3856b5942df09315c1b6177972f6",
      "ru": "В минуту опасности эта шляпа призывает призрачных оленей, которые вас лечат.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/beetle_mask.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "2e2171aa22b9084f95273759b58ced6b56de6f0383da0d5122b48943279c3e3a",
      "ru": "Из панциря можно создать устрашающую маску.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/beetle_mask.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/1/text",
      "source_sha256": "ff607581801fbf4cfbc60d8125610ae2715807c1c7dcf3c29d0a5d3693fea561",
      "ru": "Маска призывает призрачных жуков, помогающих в бою.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/copper_armor.json",
      "pointer": "/name",
      "source_sha256": "8e56b77a7d1dedaee90629d72aef71339e20eb6b07d6c60dbaca6bfa169ef5b7",
      "ru": "Медная броня",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/copper_armor.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "e7ab2f1654e2e79ab1d6abd9ec010bfa3b2b8b4b0dc712c1d52465ff04ce3f05",
      "ru": "Из меди получается удивительно прочная броня, которая также увеличивает ваш максимальный запас здоровья, пока вы ее носите!",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/gall_apple.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "adfffe478a669d31402c8799e94f890936051989f810241751be5e5ccb2e10e3",
      "ru": "Желчные яблоки — чернильные орешки — собирают с деревьев, заражённых личинками ос. Чтобы начать процесс, нанесите $(l:items/wasp_attractant)приманку для ос$() на дуб или тёмный дуб.$(br2)Эти наросты богаты $(l:items/tannins)танинами$() для выделки кожи.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/pearleporter.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "a5ca8d94b8856425c94537d9003c6c1dbc771261d65c63b31653b4b66fcb0b6f",
      "ru": "Жемчужный портатор — хитроумное устройство, которое извлекает $(l:items/pearls)жемчужины$() из $(l:creatures/clam)моллюсков$(), не причиняя им вреда!$(br2)Но для начала всё же понадобится одна жемчужина.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/silver_armor.json",
      "pointer": "/name",
      "source_sha256": "ccf02d6bf81563824ed43efd9ef24d31303e2c42aa103edcac1d3c43e62161dd",
      "ru": "Серебряная броня",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/silver_armor.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "9264f2ebac152ceda83cca2a64f3c892cbdeda4b75e078dbc5fbf934052f9e7c",
      "ru": "Серебро дает вам броню с красивым блеском, которая увеличивает урон от атаки, а также наносит урон любой нежити, которая вас ударит!",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/tannins.json",
      "pointer": "/name",
      "source_sha256": "60c0ccea8dde3b1949ef3ea0941581e4ade380a22a9e1c3254448dc1e753aac7",
      "ru": "Производство танинов и кожи",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/tannins.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "f7e5972ae093bf1e45d302b148d020c46101686df65430a84bfc5178fb72835a",
      "ru": "Одного желчного яблока хватает на четыре пузырька танинов.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/tannins.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/1/text",
      "source_sha256": "e8d6d61bf2c711632b10a7e49942063cc164523e8390e7b60343c9dfc1fe2f3b",
      "ru": "Одного пузырька танинов хватает, чтобы выделать кожу из трёх кусков гнилой плоти.",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/wasp_attractant.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/0/text",
      "source_sha256": "156f346233c97e5c271ca822ad1438397d9f62c38bbc9f052f3bf275ed8f17cf",
      "ru": "Комбинация белков и сахаров — идеальное сочетание для привлечения ос!",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/entries/items/wasp_attractant.json",
      "pointer": "/pages/1/text",
      "source_sha256": "4692beb8456cb32e1d518adcef592ce4dce9cd9997bd81a3619d1ad28f5158a8",
      "ru": "Нанесите приманку на обычный или тёмный дуб. Осы отложат личинки, и вскоре появится $(l:items/gall_apple)желчное яблоко$().",
      "decision": "reviewed_translation",
      "consumer_contract": "Patchouli_text"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "assets/mysticalworld/patchouli_books/world_guide/en_us/templates/animal_spawn_info.json",
